{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52823","headline":"送贺秘监归会稽诗 · 郭虚己","name":"送贺秘监归会稽诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白首轻轩冕，黄冠重隐沦。\n严陵垂钓日，疏广散金辰。\n北阙辞明主，东门别故人。\n以兹敦雅俗，玄化尽归真。\n（同前）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郭虚己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52823.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52823","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}